{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26882","headline":"寄题尉迟少卿郊居 · 姚合","name":"寄题尉迟少卿郊居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"卿仕在关东，林居思不穷。\n朝衣挂壁上，廐马放田中。\n隅坐唯禅子，随行只药童。\n砌莎留宿露，庭竹出清风。\n浓翠生苔点，辛香发桂丛。\n莲池伊水入，石径远山通。\n愚者心还静，高人迹自同。\n无能相近住，终日羡邻翁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26882.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26882","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}